WEBVTT

00:45.003 --> 00:46.504
I'm Lim Ju-kyung.

00:46.588 --> 00:48.006
I'm a goddess.

00:50.633 --> 00:51.634
Only until

00:52.135 --> 00:54.012
I remove my makeup.

01:07.609 --> 01:09.694
AUTHENTICATION FAILED

01:11.488 --> 01:12.530
Hey.

01:13.239 --> 01:15.241
How come you don't recognize my face?

01:21.081 --> 01:21.915
AUTHENTICATION FAILED

01:21.998 --> 01:23.291
Damn it.

01:23.374 --> 01:26.252
Ju-young messed with my phone again.

01:27.462 --> 01:28.630
It's true.

01:28.713 --> 01:30.590
It is tiring and mortifying

01:31.174 --> 01:34.344
to live with two different faces.

01:38.848 --> 01:39.682
AUTHENTICATION SUCCESSFUL

01:58.201 --> 01:59.702
This is it.

01:59.786 --> 02:02.122
There's no other place
with this many horror comics.

02:06.376 --> 02:08.711
Where is it?

02:11.965 --> 02:12.799
Found it.

02:14.259 --> 02:15.468
YOU ARE THE DEVIL

02:28.231 --> 02:29.482
I got here first.

02:29.566 --> 02:30.859
I picked it out first.

02:53.381 --> 02:54.507
Lee Soo-ho?

02:56.301 --> 02:57.135
You're…

02:57.927 --> 02:59.012
Who are…

03:04.392 --> 03:05.226
I'm sorry.

03:06.352 --> 03:07.186
Hey.

03:08.771 --> 03:09.981
Did he recognize me?

03:12.984 --> 03:14.110
That book,

03:14.819 --> 03:16.154
I grabbed it first.

03:17.572 --> 03:18.656
Okay?

03:20.575 --> 03:21.492
I see.

03:22.285 --> 03:26.205
Then you can go ahead and read it first.

03:27.206 --> 03:28.291
Here.

03:29.375 --> 03:31.210
Ju-bal, have some instant noodles.

03:31.294 --> 03:32.503
Excuse me?

03:32.587 --> 03:34.255
I didn't order one.

03:34.339 --> 03:37.175
It's on me to celebrate our reunion.

03:37.258 --> 03:39.469
- I'll have it next time.
- Hold on.

03:41.304 --> 03:43.181
I put in an organic egg just for you.

03:43.264 --> 03:45.767
It's 700 won per egg.
I'd be upset if you didn't eat it.

03:45.850 --> 03:48.645
Can't you just have it instead?

03:48.728 --> 03:49.938
I'm on a diet.

03:56.110 --> 03:56.945
Okay.

03:57.028 --> 03:58.905
Let's scarf it down and get out.

04:15.797 --> 04:16.965
That's actually mine.

04:19.342 --> 04:20.176
I'm sorry.

04:20.927 --> 04:24.013
You must like red ginseng juice.
I'll get you a new one.

04:24.681 --> 04:25.515
That's all right.

04:27.767 --> 04:28.768
Read it if you'd like.

04:29.602 --> 04:31.396
No. There's no need for that.

04:31.980 --> 04:34.148
Didn't you just launch yourself
at me to get it?

04:35.024 --> 04:36.109
Go on, read it.

04:48.329 --> 04:50.540
YOU ARE THE DEVIL

05:12.478 --> 05:14.230
I guess he didn't recognize me.

05:17.483 --> 05:18.401
Hey.

05:19.986 --> 05:22.572
Do you live around here?

05:24.365 --> 05:25.908
I mean,

05:25.992 --> 05:27.452
I'm not trying to pry.

05:27.535 --> 05:29.746
With your looks,
you're quite the eye-catcher

05:29.829 --> 05:32.206
but I don't think
I've seen you around here before.

05:32.957 --> 05:35.835
If that's true,
then I must not live around here.

05:36.419 --> 05:37.295
Right.

05:39.005 --> 05:40.923
Why crawl all the way out here then?

05:41.007 --> 05:42.425
Crawl?

05:43.176 --> 05:45.970
I started walking upright
when I was 11 months old.

05:46.471 --> 05:48.181
So you did.

05:49.807 --> 05:50.683
I'm 18.

05:51.559 --> 05:52.393
Excuse me?

05:52.477 --> 05:54.937
You're probably my age.
Your formality irks me.

05:56.773 --> 05:58.024
How old are you?

06:02.153 --> 06:05.198
I'm 15. I'm an 8th grader.

06:05.698 --> 06:08.201
I don't buy that you're younger than me,

06:08.284 --> 06:09.619
ma'am.

06:10.912 --> 06:13.039
I was just joking.
I'm 25, way older than you.

06:13.122 --> 06:14.373
So you're also 18.

06:16.501 --> 06:18.503
No wonder he's the top student.

06:25.009 --> 06:25.885
Gosh, I'm full.

06:26.803 --> 06:27.762
That was interesting.

06:27.845 --> 06:29.764
- Here you go. Enjoy.
- So soon?

06:30.848 --> 06:32.809
- I read very fast.
- I meant this.

06:35.061 --> 06:35.937
It's my specialty.

06:36.813 --> 06:37.647
Goodbye then.

06:46.906 --> 06:48.866
PRINCE COMICS

06:55.665 --> 06:56.999
What am I wearing?

06:58.543 --> 07:01.546
Why did I have to run into him
right then and there?

07:12.557 --> 07:14.725
Hey, what's with your attitude?

07:17.812 --> 07:19.147
Where's my comic book?

07:20.106 --> 07:22.275
I don't know. It's all because of you.

07:23.109 --> 07:23.943
What?

07:24.026 --> 07:27.864
Did you run into a handsome guy from class
without wearing any makeup?

07:28.906 --> 07:32.452
Then again, your life's not a TV show.
I doubt that would happen.

07:36.289 --> 07:37.832
Seriously?

07:37.915 --> 07:40.960
Your life as a goddess is over
even if I don't share your picture!

07:41.043 --> 07:43.796
That's not it. He didn't recognize me.

07:43.880 --> 07:46.174
He might not today,
but when he sees you tomorrow,

07:46.257 --> 07:49.010
"Aren't you that acne girl
from the comics shop?"

07:49.093 --> 07:50.720
- That could happen.
- What?

07:51.929 --> 07:54.640
Really? Do you think so?
Then what do I do?

07:54.724 --> 07:56.392
That's why you have to be honest.

07:56.476 --> 07:58.311
Ju-kyung, you are conning people.

07:58.394 --> 08:00.062
Just show them who you are.

08:00.146 --> 08:02.523
You can't hide your true face forever.

08:05.151 --> 08:05.985
Hey, Lim Ju-young.

08:06.986 --> 08:07.820
What?

08:08.488 --> 08:11.991
- You know that girl you have a thing with?
- Yes. What about her?

08:12.074 --> 08:13.493
She's super pretty.

08:13.576 --> 08:16.746
Her face without makeup
won't be too different from mine.

08:18.247 --> 08:19.624
No way!

08:19.707 --> 08:21.584
Even her breath is fragrant!

08:46.359 --> 08:47.777
How did I run into her here?

08:49.403 --> 08:52.198
But how can she ignore me
after all I did for her?

08:53.699 --> 08:55.368
Goodness.

08:55.451 --> 08:58.412
Ju-bal didn't leave a single drop.

08:58.955 --> 08:59.956
Her name is Ju-bal?

09:00.039 --> 09:02.208
You don't know Pandora's daughter Ju-bal?

09:02.291 --> 09:05.378
You've been a patron for a while.
You haven't seen her before?

09:09.173 --> 09:10.424
Why? Are you interested?

09:11.842 --> 09:12.802
No.

09:23.771 --> 09:25.606
I was lucky yesterday.

09:27.733 --> 09:30.152
But there's no guarantee

09:30.236 --> 09:31.445
I'll be lucky today too.

09:33.406 --> 09:36.242
A perfect disguise
is my only way to survive.

09:48.421 --> 09:49.505
More contour.

10:13.988 --> 10:15.323
Hee-kyung!

10:15.406 --> 10:17.283
- What?
- Glad I caught you. Give me a ride.

10:17.366 --> 10:20.244
You're still here?
You're late putting makeup on again.

10:20.328 --> 10:21.829
That's not it. Please hurry.

10:21.912 --> 10:23.122
Where is my little sister?

10:23.205 --> 10:26.959
PANDORA SHOP

10:32.548 --> 10:35.134
Why are you staring
at my husband like that?

10:35.217 --> 10:36.802
You can take him if you want.

10:36.886 --> 10:38.387
You've got to be kidding.

10:40.222 --> 10:42.642
I think this whenever I see your husband.

10:43.309 --> 10:45.478
He is really good-looking.

10:45.561 --> 10:48.898
Please. That doesn't pay the bills.

10:49.523 --> 10:52.360
His looks are of no value.

10:56.906 --> 10:58.866
Just take a look at that.

10:58.949 --> 11:01.243
Now I have to pay for whatever that is.

11:03.579 --> 11:05.498
- What's wrong, Dad?
- See you later, girls.

11:05.581 --> 11:07.166
Drive safely!

11:08.709 --> 11:11.212
And you, study hard.
Don't fall asleep in class.

11:11.295 --> 11:12.338
Okay.

11:12.421 --> 11:16.175
I didn't know you had another pretty girl
other than Hee-kyung and Ju-kyung.

11:16.258 --> 11:17.259
What?

11:19.929 --> 11:21.514
My disguise is a success.

11:35.027 --> 11:37.780
Don't you get in trouble
for wearing this much makeup?

11:37.863 --> 11:41.492
Back in my day,
we couldn't even wear BB cream.

11:41.575 --> 11:43.119
"Back in my day."

11:43.202 --> 11:46.122
- You'll soon be called a boomer.
- Nonsense.

11:46.205 --> 11:47.415
I'm still cool.

11:47.498 --> 11:49.417
I drink iced Americanos, not lattes,
even when it's freezing.

11:49.500 --> 11:51.544
That's how cool I am.

11:51.627 --> 11:53.754
All right. Thanks, Hee-kyung.

11:53.838 --> 11:56.048
- Okay. Have a good day!
- Okay.

12:23.826 --> 12:24.660
Well…

12:25.161 --> 12:25.995
Hi.

12:28.831 --> 12:31.333
Thank goodness. He didn't recognize me.

12:31.417 --> 12:32.460
Did you get it?

12:34.003 --> 12:35.087
Su-jin!

12:40.092 --> 12:41.802
- Delete them.
- What do you mean?

12:42.595 --> 12:43.971
Or I'll throw this away.

12:44.930 --> 12:46.223
Okay.

12:46.307 --> 12:48.434
I'll delete them, so give it back.

12:51.187 --> 12:52.188
He's scary.

12:53.022 --> 12:55.274
If he catches anything, it's done.

12:55.357 --> 12:57.610
He hates when people take photos of him.

12:57.693 --> 13:01.155
But still, he's truly something else.

13:01.739 --> 13:02.865
Let's go.

13:06.076 --> 13:08.287
Good morning. Can I please get one latte…

13:09.371 --> 13:11.540
Can I please get an iced Americano?

13:11.624 --> 13:12.958
- Extra cold.
- Sure.

13:24.053 --> 13:25.971
- Why aren't you going?
- I don't want to go.

13:26.472 --> 13:28.098
But all your friends are going.

13:28.182 --> 13:30.226
No, I want to be with you, Mom.

13:30.309 --> 13:32.853
But you have to. You can't just stay here.

13:32.937 --> 13:35.064
Ta-da! Hi!

13:53.332 --> 13:54.416
Let's go.

14:31.787 --> 14:34.540
Your iced Americano is ready.

14:38.002 --> 14:39.461
Would you like a stamp card?

14:39.545 --> 14:40.713
Yes, please.

14:40.796 --> 14:42.631
It seems like I'll be coming here often.

14:49.597 --> 14:51.557
Can I get a foundation
with the highest coverage?

14:51.640 --> 14:54.476
Try this for now.
I'll be back with the highest we have.

14:54.560 --> 14:55.394
Okay.

14:55.895 --> 14:57.771
Hey, look at this.

14:58.397 --> 14:59.815
It's super pretty.

15:30.387 --> 15:32.681
- It doesn't wash off.
- The ugliness is still there.

15:32.765 --> 15:35.726
What are we going to do about your face?

15:35.809 --> 15:37.269
Are you okay?

15:38.395 --> 15:39.396
It was just a prank.

15:40.856 --> 15:42.900
- That's funny.
- Is it?

15:43.817 --> 15:45.694
- What do we do with her?
- I don't know.

15:46.195 --> 15:47.154
Seriously.

15:58.874 --> 15:59.917
What was that?

16:14.473 --> 16:16.392
Here's the one you were looking for.

16:50.342 --> 16:51.218
Stop right there!

16:55.014 --> 16:56.640
Hey, stop!

16:57.182 --> 16:59.226
Hey, Han Seo-jun, stop!

17:06.025 --> 17:07.067
Hey!

17:08.068 --> 17:09.153
We told you to stop!

17:09.236 --> 17:11.739
- Let's move fast.
- He must have gone there.

17:31.633 --> 17:33.385
Excuse me, are you okay?

17:35.679 --> 17:36.764
Goodness.

17:37.473 --> 17:38.432
Are you hurt?

17:49.151 --> 17:51.028
- Hey, stop right there!
- Stop!

17:53.906 --> 17:54.865
Stop!

17:55.365 --> 17:56.450
Han Seo-jun! Hey!

17:56.533 --> 17:58.660
- Hurry!
- Get him!

18:05.292 --> 18:06.126
Go get him!

18:06.210 --> 18:07.086
- Hey!
- Hurry!

18:07.169 --> 18:08.462
- Hey!
- Stop!

18:08.545 --> 18:10.172
- Stop right there!
- Hurry!

18:19.348 --> 18:20.557
- Hurry!
- Hey, over there!

18:20.641 --> 18:21.809
- There!
- Get him!

18:21.892 --> 18:22.726
Han Seo-jun!

18:22.810 --> 18:24.103
- Darn it.
- Stop there!

18:24.186 --> 18:25.020
Hurry!

18:30.484 --> 18:32.903
- Come on!
- Stop right there!

18:36.573 --> 18:38.951
- Hey!
- Stop!

18:39.034 --> 18:41.578
- Stop!
- Get him!

18:41.662 --> 18:42.830
- Hurry up!
- Jeez!

18:52.005 --> 18:53.590
Why are you running away?

18:55.425 --> 18:57.219
Come over here. Come on.

18:58.887 --> 19:00.097
Are you okay?

19:00.180 --> 19:01.890
- Get that punk.
- Get him.

19:01.974 --> 19:03.642
- Get him.
- Hurry!

19:12.985 --> 19:13.986
Han Seo-jun.

19:14.069 --> 19:16.113
Kim Cho-rong told me
you went to study abroad.

19:18.031 --> 19:19.491
You thought we would buy that?

19:19.575 --> 19:21.034
I'm sorry, you punk.

19:24.121 --> 19:25.497
You crazy punk.

19:26.081 --> 19:28.959
I went through so much because of you.

19:29.042 --> 19:30.502
I'm still mad thinking about it.

19:31.753 --> 19:32.588
Hey.

19:34.298 --> 19:36.633
You didn't come out that day
to mess with us, right?

19:37.551 --> 19:40.596
You thought we'd leave you alone
if you just avoided us?

19:41.805 --> 19:42.973
Not my face.

19:48.770 --> 19:49.855
You dodged?

19:50.689 --> 19:52.191
You're dead meat.

19:52.274 --> 19:54.443
I think the police are here.

19:54.526 --> 19:55.527
Let's go.

19:56.570 --> 19:57.654
Let's go.

19:57.738 --> 20:00.157
- Let's go. Come on.
- I'll see you again, Han Seo-jun.

20:00.240 --> 20:01.491
Hey, let's go!

20:04.369 --> 20:05.621
Hey, let's go!

20:16.340 --> 20:17.299
Did they leave?

20:25.807 --> 20:26.642
Who are you?

20:27.893 --> 20:28.727
I…

20:29.645 --> 20:30.479
Well…

20:33.232 --> 20:34.399
What is that?

20:36.360 --> 20:37.361
What are you doing?

20:38.570 --> 20:39.655
Darn it.

21:02.135 --> 21:02.970
What?

21:05.514 --> 21:07.057
Thank…

21:08.517 --> 21:09.977
you!

21:12.813 --> 21:14.231
Saebom High?

21:17.985 --> 21:18.986
Wait, my helmet!

21:19.945 --> 21:20.779
Hey!

21:23.115 --> 21:24.408
Darn it.

21:35.752 --> 21:38.714
I almost got involved with the delinquents
trying to avoid Sam-mi.

21:41.925 --> 21:42.801
What the…

21:43.677 --> 21:45.262
Why did I take this with me?

21:46.054 --> 21:47.556
Is he coming after me for this?

21:48.056 --> 21:48.890
Hey!

21:49.933 --> 21:51.727
- Acne girl from the comics shop?
- No.

21:51.810 --> 21:53.895
Lim Ju-bal, did you get spooked?

21:54.646 --> 21:56.148
Ju-young, I'll kill you!

21:56.732 --> 21:57.774
Come here!

21:59.401 --> 22:00.402
Stop there!

22:00.986 --> 22:02.904
- Come here.
- On today's entertainment news…

22:02.988 --> 22:06.074
- You're dead meat.
- Hey, kids.

22:06.158 --> 22:07.701
Be quiet, you brats.

22:08.368 --> 22:09.494
Ju-hun is on.

22:09.578 --> 22:10.871
It's an attempted murder.

22:10.954 --> 22:12.205
Ju-hun, my foot.

22:12.289 --> 22:13.999
- You punk.
- You're so heavy, pig!

22:14.082 --> 22:15.000
Why you…

22:15.083 --> 22:16.293
Come here!

22:17.461 --> 22:19.880
It's been seven years
since your last project, Love Maze.

22:19.963 --> 22:22.341
- How have you been?
- Lucky Hee-kyung.

22:22.424 --> 22:24.259
After the series and overseas schedule…

22:24.343 --> 22:26.762
She gets to work under
a handsome CEO like that.

22:27.596 --> 22:29.306
Handsome, my foot.

22:30.307 --> 22:33.977
How does it feel to be back
in Korea after seven years?

22:34.978 --> 22:36.897
- I didn't get to see my son much.
- Jeez.

22:36.980 --> 22:38.899
due to being overseas.

22:38.982 --> 22:43.320
I plan on spending
more time with my son from now on.

22:44.237 --> 22:46.031
I haven't been a good dad.

22:50.994 --> 22:52.329
Hey, son.

22:52.412 --> 22:54.456
It's really hard to catch you.

22:57.042 --> 22:59.086
This place is still the same.

22:59.169 --> 23:03.131
I basically lived here
back when I was training for a role.

23:03.924 --> 23:05.550
Master Choi treats you well, right?

23:06.134 --> 23:07.761
Why did you suddenly come back?

23:07.844 --> 23:08.845
Right.

23:09.763 --> 23:13.225
I had a lot going on at the company,
especially after the merger.

23:14.684 --> 23:16.603
I'd also lose relevance
if I were away for too long.

23:17.771 --> 23:19.064
You care about your fans deeply.

23:22.192 --> 23:25.195
It's you that I care about, Soo-ho.

23:28.156 --> 23:29.199
You're leaving already?

23:31.368 --> 23:34.371
I wanted to do some exercise myself.

23:36.748 --> 23:37.791
Go ahead.

23:42.420 --> 23:44.089
That was too easy, don't you think?

24:02.858 --> 24:04.484
Someone taught you well.

25:17.390 --> 25:18.308
My goodness.

25:19.559 --> 25:21.770
You're a grown man now.

25:22.562 --> 25:25.607
Goodness, I must be getting old.

25:25.690 --> 25:28.777
I'm not a match for you, am I?

25:30.737 --> 25:32.030
It's your birthday tomorrow.

25:32.739 --> 25:34.491
Do you want to eat out somewhere nice?

25:35.033 --> 25:35.867
No.

25:37.035 --> 25:38.620
Is there anything you want?

25:39.204 --> 25:40.205
No.

25:43.416 --> 25:44.459
Have you thought about…

25:45.418 --> 25:47.254
moving back to my place?

25:47.337 --> 25:48.713
I already said no.

25:49.839 --> 25:51.216
You'll soon be a senior, and--

25:51.299 --> 25:55.220
Wouldn't you also feel uncomfortable
if I lived with you?

25:56.638 --> 25:58.181
What about your love life?

26:00.183 --> 26:02.143
Don't come by unannounced from now on.

26:03.353 --> 26:05.772
I don't want to be known
as Lee Ju-hun's son.

26:24.749 --> 26:25.583
No…

26:26.334 --> 26:27.252
No…

26:52.944 --> 26:55.280
Which one's better
for a 100th-day anniversary gift?

26:55.363 --> 26:56.406
The one on the left.

26:56.489 --> 26:58.992
Only 100 days? You fussed so much
I thought it was 100 years.

26:59.075 --> 27:01.161
I made a huge fuss
when I was 100 days old too.

27:01.244 --> 27:02.203
Bear with me, Kangsu.

27:02.287 --> 27:04.247
Guys, I'm so glad we're friends.

27:04.331 --> 27:06.499
I'm glad to have
a goddess friend like you.

27:06.583 --> 27:10.253
I'm not a goddess.
If I'm a goddess, you are a fairy.

27:10.337 --> 27:13.340
Limju, how are you both pretty and sweet?

27:17.510 --> 27:18.803
Goddess, my foot.

27:19.387 --> 27:21.639
My skin's getting worse because of makeup.

27:23.558 --> 27:25.935
I need to do something to calm it down.

27:30.690 --> 27:33.818
Hey, return this.
Mr. Prince said he needs it right away.

27:33.902 --> 27:35.320
When did he borrow it?

27:35.403 --> 27:37.155
Why would I return it?

27:37.238 --> 27:39.032
I still have your pictures.

27:39.866 --> 27:40.700
That punk.

27:41.910 --> 27:43.370
If I were Lee Soo-ho,

27:44.746 --> 27:45.830
"Delete them."

27:46.414 --> 27:48.375
"Or I'll throw this away."

27:48.458 --> 27:50.668
I'm borrowing these. Keep the change.

27:52.712 --> 27:54.172
This is for you.

28:01.388 --> 28:02.222
Hey.

28:03.473 --> 28:04.724
Hey, Ju-bal.

28:05.725 --> 28:08.561
- Lee Soo-ho's not here, is he?
- Who?

28:08.645 --> 28:12.273
The guy who's aloof and has a tiny face,
like a lead in a romance comic.

28:13.775 --> 28:14.818
You mean, me?

28:14.901 --> 28:17.028
The guy who likes red ginseng juice.

28:17.112 --> 28:19.155
Right. He rarely comes on weekends.

28:19.239 --> 28:20.949
Really? Thank goodness.

28:21.032 --> 28:22.283
I'm returning this.

28:24.911 --> 28:25.745
Ju-bal.

28:26.413 --> 28:27.247
Yes?

28:27.330 --> 28:29.207
- Do you have a moment?
- Why?

28:29.290 --> 28:32.293
My stomach is having a bit of a situation.

28:32.377 --> 28:34.254
- Can you take my place for a bit?
- But…

28:35.171 --> 28:36.756
What if someone comes?

28:47.642 --> 28:49.269
This series is still here.

28:51.438 --> 28:52.605
A CURSE IN DARKNESS

28:53.565 --> 28:54.441
Goodness.

28:58.069 --> 28:59.988
I used to collect these.

29:00.655 --> 29:01.865
I guess nobody took it.

29:03.491 --> 29:05.285
I'll take this for my pay.

29:07.912 --> 29:08.788
We meet again.

29:16.087 --> 29:17.130
Darn it.

29:20.884 --> 29:21.926
Are you not coming down?

29:23.511 --> 29:24.554
I'm looking for a book.

29:27.515 --> 29:30.143
Then can you get me that book over there?

29:33.688 --> 29:35.690
- This one?
- The one next to it.

29:37.650 --> 29:39.068
- This one?
- A bit further.

29:40.403 --> 29:41.571
This one?

29:41.654 --> 29:43.156
How long are you going to pretend?

29:45.116 --> 29:45.992
You know me.

30:17.106 --> 30:19.067
Thanks, Ju-bal!

30:24.447 --> 30:27.283
You always get in my arms.
It's becoming a habit.

30:27.784 --> 30:29.786
You need to learn to keep your balance.

30:29.869 --> 30:31.287
It's not that hard.

30:33.164 --> 30:36.125
People like you
should be banned from using footstools.

30:37.293 --> 30:39.254
What you said caught me off guard.

30:39.337 --> 30:41.589
I'm not that good of an actor
to keep pretending.

30:41.673 --> 30:42.507
Then…

30:43.508 --> 30:46.594
you recognized me right away last time?

30:46.678 --> 30:48.221
Fortunately, I have a good memory.

30:48.304 --> 30:50.598
This isn't a matter
of having a good memory.

30:51.432 --> 30:52.642
You must have eagle eyes.

30:57.355 --> 30:58.606
It's you, even at a glance.

30:58.690 --> 31:00.567
My face is totally different.

31:00.650 --> 31:04.320
- Are we playing "find the difference"?
- I mean, they are two different faces.

31:11.786 --> 31:13.997
I see. The eyes are different.

31:14.080 --> 31:14.914
Eyes?

31:17.917 --> 31:20.587
Right. They're the most different.

31:21.796 --> 31:23.631
Am I in the wrong for recognizing you?

31:24.299 --> 31:25.675
No, it's not that.

31:27.343 --> 31:29.470
I just can't believe this is happening.

31:30.889 --> 31:32.473
Are you going to tell people?

31:33.141 --> 31:35.310
- Tell people what?
- That I'm like this?

31:35.393 --> 31:36.686
What are you like?

31:36.769 --> 31:38.897
You see what I look like right now.

31:39.480 --> 31:41.107
I'm a mess.

31:41.774 --> 31:45.236
If people find out,
I won't be able to show my face.

31:45.904 --> 31:48.281
Is she talking about the rooftop incident?

31:49.032 --> 31:50.325
Why do you feel that way?

31:50.408 --> 31:51.743
I just do.

31:53.745 --> 31:56.414
Please, can you just keep it a secret?

32:00.001 --> 32:01.002
Please.

32:01.628 --> 32:03.796
But it's Lee Soo-ho, the sociopath.

32:04.380 --> 32:05.632
Okay.

32:06.299 --> 32:07.133
Okay.

32:07.759 --> 32:09.135
There's no way you'd--

32:10.178 --> 32:11.054
What?

32:11.554 --> 32:13.723
Really? That easily?

32:14.390 --> 32:16.976
Do I seem like the type
to spill the beans on you?

32:17.810 --> 32:19.395
No, but…

32:23.900 --> 32:25.944
How do I know you'll keep your word?

32:27.946 --> 32:29.530
So what if you don't?

32:29.614 --> 32:33.326
CONFIDENTIALITY AGREEMENT

32:34.077 --> 32:35.244
Is this really necessary?

32:35.328 --> 32:37.497
This is how desperate I am.

32:38.623 --> 32:39.582
Please sign here.

32:41.918 --> 32:43.002
I don't think so.

32:43.586 --> 32:46.589
A truly desperate person
wouldn't copy a page from Hell's Pledge.

32:46.673 --> 32:47.757
I wrote it in a hurry so--

32:49.175 --> 32:50.385
You know Hell's Pledge?

32:51.594 --> 32:53.513
It's a very old comic.
Not many know of it.

32:53.596 --> 32:55.056
How could I not know?

32:55.139 --> 32:57.850
With a modern drawing style
that holds up after 30 years,

32:57.934 --> 33:00.144
it's the first domestic series
to fuse occult horror and SF

33:00.228 --> 33:01.562
and the finest of the 20th century.

33:02.772 --> 33:04.774
It feels surreal to finally meet
someone who knows about it.

33:04.857 --> 33:07.110
I personally prefer
the author's previous work,

33:07.193 --> 33:08.027
- Cursed Mask.
- Cursed Mask.

33:09.070 --> 33:11.114
- Amazing.
- You know Cursed Mask?

33:11.197 --> 33:12.949
That's what got me into horror comics.

33:13.032 --> 33:14.742
I even have a signed first edition.

33:14.826 --> 33:15.868
You do?

33:18.079 --> 33:18.913
Yes.

33:19.580 --> 33:20.415
Why?

33:20.498 --> 33:24.335
I've been trying so hard to find
the first edition for two years…

33:25.503 --> 33:26.838
and you have it?

33:28.381 --> 33:30.842
I've been into horror comics
for a while now.

33:31.843 --> 33:32.760
How much?

33:33.428 --> 33:34.512
I don't think so.

33:35.179 --> 33:39.392
A truly desperate person wouldn't just
throw money at their problems.

33:42.061 --> 33:44.188
LEE SOO-HO

33:46.899 --> 33:48.901
That's done. What else?

33:48.985 --> 33:51.195
He's a different person outside of school.

33:52.238 --> 33:53.656
Perhaps a bit gullible too.

33:57.452 --> 33:58.703
I'm parched.

34:16.512 --> 34:18.306
I feel somewhat peckish.

34:19.057 --> 34:19.932
So what?

34:20.016 --> 34:21.184
Are you desperate?

34:23.436 --> 34:26.731
I shouldn't have done that.

34:36.491 --> 34:38.826
RESERVED FOR LIM JU-KYUNG.
SIT HERE AND YOU'LL GROW BUTT HAIR.

34:38.910 --> 34:40.328
If you saw me at school,

34:40.411 --> 34:42.789
- you wouldn't dare do this to me.
- What?

34:42.872 --> 34:45.750
You promised me Cursed Mask
for two bowls of instant noodles.

34:45.833 --> 34:48.127
Actually, I'll settle for just one bowl.

34:50.296 --> 34:51.589
This is a bribe from me.

34:52.590 --> 34:55.426
- Bribe?
- For keeping my secret.

34:55.510 --> 34:57.011
Go ahead, eat.

34:57.804 --> 35:00.640
I'm having instant noodles
with Lee Soo-ho at a comics rental shop.

35:00.723 --> 35:02.683
The whole school would freak out
if they knew.

35:10.108 --> 35:13.820
I always wondered why there were
so many splatters on the pages.

35:13.903 --> 35:16.823
Hey, eating instant noodles
at the comic shop is the best.

35:16.906 --> 35:18.282
You'll regret it if you don't.

35:20.368 --> 35:22.954
Don't you want your Cursed Mask?

35:34.048 --> 35:35.716
Isn't it good?

35:35.800 --> 35:38.386
It's good for the first meal
on my birthday.

35:40.805 --> 35:42.390
It's your birthday today?

35:44.350 --> 35:45.977
Then what are you doing here?

35:52.400 --> 35:53.734
Do you like watching people eat?

36:00.283 --> 36:03.161
Hey. Don't sniff it in.

36:03.244 --> 36:04.620
Just look away.

36:07.039 --> 36:08.875
- What do I do?
- Pull it out.

36:08.958 --> 36:10.501
- Pull it?
- No, just sniff it in.

36:12.795 --> 36:14.005
My nose hurts.

36:14.505 --> 36:19.802
PRINCE COMICS

36:22.305 --> 36:25.683
I'll give you the copy
of Cursed Mask on Monday.

36:26.350 --> 36:27.560
- Okay.
- Right.

36:30.188 --> 36:32.106
- Here.
- Another bribe?

36:32.190 --> 36:33.441
No, a gift.

36:35.902 --> 36:37.904
This is a very rare item
that's 20 years old.

36:37.987 --> 36:40.781
I came across it,
but I'm specially giving it to you.

36:42.575 --> 36:45.244
You're now my friend
I've shared my secret with,

36:45.328 --> 36:46.746
so I should care for you.

36:50.791 --> 36:52.251
Happy birthday.

37:24.617 --> 37:25.785
Happy birthday.

37:59.151 --> 38:00.278
LEE SOO-HO

38:00.361 --> 38:01.821
Spotless.

38:04.991 --> 38:06.367
CURSED MASK

38:07.535 --> 38:09.954
Thanks for keeping a secret
about my no-makeup face!

38:22.049 --> 38:24.093
I look totally different without makeup.

38:24.719 --> 38:26.637
How did he recognize me?

38:27.513 --> 38:28.931
So strange.

38:34.770 --> 38:36.105
Sir, stop the bus!

38:36.188 --> 38:37.732
- Hang on!
- Wait!

38:48.075 --> 38:49.410
Thank you.

38:52.121 --> 38:53.289
A true beauty is here.

38:53.372 --> 38:55.249
Seriously, what a goddess.

38:56.250 --> 38:58.878
- Amazing.
- I'm so glad I stopped the bus.

38:58.961 --> 39:00.212
Hi.

39:00.296 --> 39:01.964
She's gorgeous.

39:02.048 --> 39:03.257
She looks like a goddess.

39:55.601 --> 39:57.311
- Give me your phone.
- What's this?

39:57.395 --> 39:59.271
You pervert, I saw you taking pictures!

39:59.855 --> 40:01.816
- Ju-kyung, hurry and call the police.
- What?

40:01.899 --> 40:03.526
- Disgusting.
- Damn it.

40:04.527 --> 40:06.278
- Get out of my way.
- That punk. Hey!

40:07.154 --> 40:08.280
- Su-jin!
- Hey!

40:09.073 --> 40:10.408
Stop right there!

40:10.491 --> 40:12.284
Stop or I'll kill you!

40:18.624 --> 40:20.668
Hey, stop!

40:34.807 --> 40:36.517
I said, stop!

40:57.872 --> 41:01.041
Arrest this pervert!
You'll find all the evidence on his phone.

41:01.125 --> 41:01.959
Okay.

41:05.588 --> 41:07.006
I tapped my card earlier.

41:07.965 --> 41:09.467
She brought justice!

41:09.550 --> 41:10.968
- Were you startled?
- Yes.

41:11.719 --> 41:13.137
You were so amazing.

41:13.220 --> 41:15.181
I mean, are you okay?

41:16.765 --> 41:19.643
Su-jin, I would love to
have a boyfriend like you.

41:20.561 --> 41:21.812
Whatever.

41:23.522 --> 41:25.191
I'm not surprised.

41:25.274 --> 41:27.776
She scolded middle schoolers
for smoking last time.

41:27.860 --> 41:29.236
She's my girl crush.

41:29.320 --> 41:30.362
Stop it.

41:31.447 --> 41:34.533
I was so shocked to see
my skirt not zip up this morning.

41:34.617 --> 41:36.952
I'd love a skirt with an elastic band.

41:37.620 --> 41:39.914
Limju, what was your old uniform like?

41:39.997 --> 41:41.790
I want to see it. Do you have pictures?

41:41.874 --> 41:42.750
Well…

41:43.501 --> 41:45.085
I didn't take any pictures.

41:45.169 --> 41:48.047
Don't lie.
Your uniform was ugly, wasn't it?

41:48.130 --> 41:49.715
Let me see.

41:50.257 --> 41:51.759
- Well…
- Please?

41:53.469 --> 41:54.803
- Well…
- Move.

41:56.847 --> 41:57.765
Move.

42:02.228 --> 42:03.687
Saved by the bell.

42:03.771 --> 42:06.023
- Soo-ho, be nice.
- Typical.

42:06.106 --> 42:07.900
- Hi, Tu-ah.
- Hi, babe!

42:08.484 --> 42:09.735
Watch out. A motorcycle!

42:12.029 --> 42:13.072
What the…

42:18.619 --> 42:19.787
What was that?

42:19.870 --> 42:22.206
- Seriously.
- Goodness.

42:31.757 --> 42:32.633
That guy is…

42:39.848 --> 42:40.891
He's a student here?

42:41.433 --> 42:43.811
What kind of absurd coincidence is this?

42:43.894 --> 42:45.187
I guess Han Seo-jun is back.

42:45.271 --> 42:47.147
- Why is he here?
- What's he doing here?

42:48.148 --> 42:49.358
Han Seo-jun?

42:49.441 --> 42:51.777
Like the Bermuda Triangle
or a black hole in space,

42:51.860 --> 42:56.532
the charms of these two guys
can suck you right in with no escape.

43:05.958 --> 43:08.127
- Goodness!
- Seriously, what do I do?

43:08.210 --> 43:11.213
I'll report you for stealing my heart!

43:12.715 --> 43:14.091
You're too much for my heart.

43:14.174 --> 43:16.343
- Look!
- Gosh, he's so gorgeous!

43:20.347 --> 43:21.890
- Let's move!
- Hey, we're late!

43:23.475 --> 43:24.435
Seo-jun!

43:24.518 --> 43:25.644
Seo-jun!

43:33.819 --> 43:35.070
Savior Soo-ho, the nonchalant adonis

43:35.154 --> 43:36.488
versus Seo-jun Almighty,
the untamed rebel.

43:36.572 --> 43:38.157
Deciding who's hotter is a conundrum

43:38.240 --> 43:40.451
like donuts versus ice cream
or pizza versus fried chicken.

43:40.534 --> 43:42.620
They're Saebom High's two gods,
the two towers.

43:44.079 --> 43:45.789
That was too cringey.

43:45.873 --> 43:47.583
Babe, then what about me?

43:47.666 --> 43:50.085
You are the one and only of my heart.

43:51.420 --> 43:53.756
I actually don't care for either of them.

43:53.839 --> 43:56.050
- I feel sick.
- Want to die?

44:05.726 --> 44:06.894
Hey, Han Seo-jun is back.

44:06.977 --> 44:09.271
I guess they're going to fight again.

44:09.355 --> 44:10.773
I can sense the ruckus coming.

44:10.856 --> 44:11.940
I don't mind it!

44:19.031 --> 44:22.117
By the way, what's going on?
Do they not like each other?

44:22.201 --> 44:24.578
They used to be best friends,
but things went sour.

44:24.662 --> 44:26.664
They always go after each other.

44:32.002 --> 44:33.420
Not how I want to start my day.

44:39.677 --> 44:40.636
Good morning.

44:40.719 --> 44:42.221
- Good morning.
- Good morning.

44:42.304 --> 44:44.306
- Good morning.
- Good morning.

44:45.599 --> 44:48.560
So Seo-jun is finally back.
It's nice to see him again, right?

44:48.644 --> 44:49.520
- Yes.
- Yes.

44:49.603 --> 44:51.188
Should we give a warm welcome?

44:54.566 --> 44:56.360
- Welcome back!
- Welcome back!

44:56.443 --> 44:59.488
Seo-jun, you can sit next to Soo-ho.

44:59.571 --> 45:00.406
Excuse me?

45:09.123 --> 45:11.041
Hey, you move over there.

45:13.627 --> 45:15.671
- Me?
- This used to be my seat.

45:16.505 --> 45:20.384
She's sitting there
because of her bad eyesight.

45:20.467 --> 45:22.553
Well, Tae-hoon?

45:22.636 --> 45:25.889
- Can you go sit over there, Mr. Handsome?
- Me?

45:27.433 --> 45:28.684
Seriously…

45:31.437 --> 45:33.272
Hey, neighbor!

45:35.858 --> 45:38.235
Yas, Tae-hoon, great job!

45:38.318 --> 45:40.446
- No, please stop.
- Please don't.

45:42.739 --> 45:45.492
- All right, should we start our homeroom?
- Sorry.

45:45.576 --> 45:46.743
- Yes!
- Yes!

45:48.537 --> 45:49.705
"To have a friend…

45:49.788 --> 45:51.248
- Not again.
- Come on.

45:51.331 --> 45:53.125
…is like having another life."

45:53.792 --> 45:55.836
- Mr. Han.
- Why do you do this?

45:55.919 --> 45:57.004
He's doing it again.

45:57.087 --> 45:59.673
- I want you guys to…
- I know her from somewhere.

45:59.756 --> 46:00.966
have many different lives.

46:01.049 --> 46:02.718
Mr. Han, that's too much.

46:02.801 --> 46:04.970
Please call 911.

46:05.053 --> 46:06.930
My fingers and toes
can't stand how cringey you are.

46:07.014 --> 46:08.765
Hyun-kyu, I have a cure for you.

46:08.849 --> 46:10.392
A cure? What is it?

46:12.853 --> 46:14.563
Yes, I'm all healed.

46:14.646 --> 46:16.398
- Have a good day, guys!
- Mr. Han!

46:32.414 --> 46:34.333
Soo-ho, what are you thinking about?

46:34.416 --> 46:37.127
The English teacher wants to see you.
Let's go.

46:42.174 --> 46:45.135
Is Su-jin friends with Soo-ho?

46:45.219 --> 46:47.095
Yes, they're pretty close.

46:47.179 --> 46:49.014
They knew each other
since they were little.

46:49.097 --> 46:52.476
Tu-jin might be the only girl
that Soo-ho talks to.

46:52.559 --> 46:54.061
I see.

46:54.144 --> 46:56.939
He must actually be nice
since he's a friend of Su-jin.

46:57.731 --> 47:00.692
The smart ones
always hang out with each other.

47:00.776 --> 47:02.694
On top of that,
they're super good-looking.

47:02.778 --> 47:03.612
Jeez.

47:04.238 --> 47:05.822
So unrelatable.

47:05.906 --> 47:08.700
Babe, that's why I keep my grades low.

47:08.784 --> 47:10.077
I want to stay relatable.

47:11.078 --> 47:13.580
Your smile is making
all of my organs breakdance.

47:13.664 --> 47:15.707
They're making my stomach ache.

47:19.795 --> 47:21.004
Hey, Han Seo-jun.

47:22.297 --> 47:24.508
You should come
pay your respects if you're back.

47:34.851 --> 47:38.230
Hey brother,
it's a perfect day to die, isn't it?

47:39.231 --> 47:42.651
Are you all a girl group or something?
Why are you standing like that?

47:44.278 --> 47:45.821
What? Are you going to punch me?

47:45.904 --> 47:48.240
All right, come on.

47:48.323 --> 47:49.241
Hey, Kim Cho-rong!

47:52.536 --> 47:54.413
This joke has gone too far!

47:57.457 --> 48:00.002
- That was great, Seo-jun!
- A real celebrity!

48:00.085 --> 48:02.087
No wonder you were a trainee.
You're a decent actor.

48:02.170 --> 48:03.880
You're so ridiculous.

48:03.964 --> 48:05.882
How long do I have to go along with this?

48:07.509 --> 48:09.928
Honestly, you enjoyed it too, didn't you?

48:12.306 --> 48:13.890
- Have you all been well?
- Yes.

48:15.434 --> 48:17.436
Cho-rong, you look
even bigger than before.

48:17.519 --> 48:19.396
- Are you trying to get buff?
- Seriously!

48:19.479 --> 48:22.232
- Hey, I've lost 10kg.
- He has muscles.

48:22.316 --> 48:24.067
Is your mom doing any better?

48:24.151 --> 48:25.902
Yes, she's doing much better.

48:26.570 --> 48:27.404
What a relief.

48:27.487 --> 48:29.031
I offer my condolences.

48:29.114 --> 48:30.198
Seriously?

48:30.282 --> 48:33.285
Condolences are for when someone dies!
You said the wrong word.

48:33.368 --> 48:35.871
- He got you.
- He's smart!

48:35.954 --> 48:37.748
Guys, come on.

48:37.831 --> 48:39.333
Then what was I supposed to say?

48:39.416 --> 48:40.417
Consolation.

48:42.586 --> 48:43.587
This is refreshing.

48:43.670 --> 48:44.755
It's refreshing?

48:44.838 --> 48:45.881
It's refreshing.

48:45.964 --> 48:49.051
By the way, Han Seo-jun seems a bit rough.

48:49.134 --> 48:50.010
Right.

48:50.719 --> 48:53.138
He definitely has a bad boy vibe.

48:54.181 --> 48:55.265
Rumor has it

48:55.349 --> 48:57.434
that it wasn't actually
a leave of absence,

48:57.517 --> 49:00.395
but a disciplinary suspension
for beating a kid to death.

49:00.937 --> 49:02.314
- Seriously?
- Yes.

49:03.482 --> 49:05.442
How do I return his helmet?

49:05.525 --> 49:07.277
This year is really not for me.

49:07.361 --> 49:08.612
What are you talking about?

49:08.695 --> 49:10.447
He said he took time off
for family matters.

49:10.530 --> 49:11.782
Nobody really knows.

49:16.161 --> 49:18.205
So she's the goddess, the new transfer?

49:18.288 --> 49:20.290
- Yes, she's super pretty, right?
- Yes.

49:20.374 --> 49:22.209
She looks pretty even when she's eating.

49:22.292 --> 49:24.002
Lucky for her classmates.

49:35.681 --> 49:37.391
Hey, look at her.

49:37.474 --> 49:39.518
She's the junior goddess
who transferred here.

49:39.601 --> 49:41.978
- She is a goddess.
- She's pretty.

49:42.062 --> 49:43.814
She's not a goddess. She's a fraud.

49:51.446 --> 49:52.280
RED GINSENG

49:53.615 --> 49:56.076
- What's this?
- I know you like it.

50:00.288 --> 50:01.206
What was that?

50:10.424 --> 50:11.800
Meet me on the rooftop.

50:18.765 --> 50:19.975
Has she gone mad?

50:32.696 --> 50:33.655
You came.

50:36.116 --> 50:38.285
What are you doing?
Are you seeking attention?

50:38.368 --> 50:41.955
Hey, no one's here, so relax.

50:42.038 --> 50:45.208
I got your jacket dry cleaned
and the stuff I promised--

50:45.292 --> 50:47.335
- Then do you like me?
- No.

50:47.419 --> 50:49.546
Then why are you acting like we're close?

50:49.629 --> 50:52.883
We saw each other yesterday.
What's wrong with you?

50:52.966 --> 50:55.594
I don't care what's going on in your head,

50:55.677 --> 50:57.220
but see the reality as it is.

50:57.304 --> 50:59.139
You're really getting on my nerves.

51:03.769 --> 51:04.644
Wait.

51:05.604 --> 51:08.106
You've never seen me outside of school?

51:09.775 --> 51:11.860
Maybe this is your way
of getting my attention,

51:12.819 --> 51:14.738
but if you ever touch me again…

51:16.490 --> 51:17.491
I won't let it slide.

51:21.495 --> 51:22.329
What?

51:22.829 --> 51:24.623
So he didn't recognize my face

51:25.791 --> 51:27.375
at the comics rental shop?

51:29.795 --> 51:32.339
Thanks for keeping a secret
about my no-makeup face!

51:37.594 --> 51:38.428
No.

51:38.929 --> 51:39.846
No!

51:47.020 --> 51:49.564
If you saw me at school,
you wouldn't dare do this to me.

51:51.316 --> 51:53.527
Why did I have to act up?

51:58.198 --> 51:59.282
Hey.

51:59.366 --> 52:00.450
Wait!

52:02.118 --> 52:03.161
Hey, wait up.

52:04.871 --> 52:06.832
I brought the wrong thing.

52:07.332 --> 52:08.458
Give it back.

52:11.378 --> 52:12.462
I can't let it rip.

52:17.759 --> 52:19.219
There are menstrual pads inside.

52:24.558 --> 52:25.892
I'll bring the right one tomorrow.

52:34.401 --> 52:37.612
Wait, then what secret
was he talking about?

52:38.530 --> 52:39.990
Has he seen me before?

52:40.866 --> 52:43.785
Whatever. What do I do?

52:45.245 --> 52:47.080
I really messed with him,

52:48.039 --> 52:50.333
so it'll be the end of me
if he actually finds out.

52:56.506 --> 52:59.759
Did you do your research
on the poets from the last class?

52:59.843 --> 53:00.927
- Yes.
- Yes.

53:01.011 --> 53:03.179
Work on your presentation with your team.

53:03.263 --> 53:04.890
- Yes.
- Yes.

53:07.183 --> 53:08.351
Hey, Han Seo-jun.

53:09.519 --> 53:11.730
- Do you know about PPT?
- What, fitting?

53:12.480 --> 53:13.607
Of course.

53:15.400 --> 53:17.694
I was a fitting model once.

53:20.947 --> 53:21.781
Sure.

53:26.036 --> 53:27.329
I'm done for.

53:27.412 --> 53:28.705
What are you doing?

53:28.788 --> 53:29.623
Hey.

53:35.170 --> 53:36.588
- I got it.
- You got it?

53:38.340 --> 53:40.926
How about we do our presentation
on resistance poets?

53:41.009 --> 53:43.887
Research would be easy,
but other teams will have the same idea.

53:43.970 --> 53:46.306
Plus, do you think
we could actually pull it off?

53:46.389 --> 53:47.974
- Hey.
- What?

53:48.058 --> 53:51.353
You're forgetting the fact that
we have the top student on our team.

53:52.687 --> 53:54.105
Ju-kyung, what do you think?

53:56.608 --> 53:58.902
"Thou art full of sorrow
with your long neck."

53:59.778 --> 54:01.363
"Always a polite creature,

54:01.446 --> 54:03.823
who seldom speaks."
Are you sleeping, Ju-kyung?

54:06.826 --> 54:09.079
- No.
- I'm glad.

54:23.301 --> 54:25.637
Let's go, punk. That's it.

54:26.846 --> 54:28.723
Take them down! All right.

54:32.727 --> 54:34.437
- She's at it again.
- That little…

54:35.105 --> 54:35.981
Hey.

54:38.858 --> 54:39.734
You're home.

54:39.818 --> 54:41.611
Hey, is there a teacher

54:41.695 --> 54:46.116
who looks like a mix of Jung Woo-sung
and Brad Pitt at your school?

54:46.199 --> 54:48.868
- No.
- Come on, think hard.

54:48.952 --> 54:50.495
He went into your school building.

54:50.578 --> 54:52.330
I'm thinking, but no.

54:52.914 --> 54:54.082
Maybe he's not a teacher.

54:54.791 --> 54:56.668
What's wrong? You're so out of energy.

54:57.877 --> 54:59.004
Just because…

55:00.505 --> 55:02.590
Life is too hard.

55:03.591 --> 55:05.802
You don't know what life is. You're 18.

55:08.221 --> 55:10.974
What about 18?
18-year-olds have lives too.

55:11.057 --> 55:14.561
Weren't you 18 at some point?
Now that you're 28, you know about life?

55:14.644 --> 55:15.729
Come here.

55:15.812 --> 55:17.147
Come here, little brat!

55:17.230 --> 55:18.314
I said, come here!

55:35.331 --> 55:36.666
Hello?

55:37.625 --> 55:38.460
It's me.

55:39.544 --> 55:40.503
Who?

55:44.716 --> 55:46.092
How did you get my number?

55:46.718 --> 55:47.719
I have my ways.

55:48.386 --> 55:49.262
What do you want?

55:49.345 --> 55:52.348
You have something for me. Bring it over.

55:54.392 --> 55:55.226
I have…

55:55.935 --> 55:57.395
something for you?

56:05.195 --> 56:06.196
What would that be?

56:06.696 --> 56:07.614
Are you kidding me?

56:08.531 --> 56:09.783
I'll text you the location.

56:11.534 --> 56:12.535
Right now?

56:16.247 --> 56:17.916
I'm not feeling too well.

56:18.500 --> 56:20.043
Can I bring it to you tomorrow?

56:20.126 --> 56:21.961
I'll come to you. What's your address?

56:23.338 --> 56:25.256
No. I'll go there.

56:25.340 --> 56:26.424
I should go meet you.

56:26.508 --> 56:27.842
Be there by 9 p.m.

56:31.971 --> 56:34.140
The cafe in front of Saebom Park. 9 p.m.

56:37.936 --> 56:39.562
But Soo-ho,

56:40.605 --> 56:42.023
who did you call just now?

56:43.691 --> 56:45.276
Lim Ju-kyung without makeup

56:45.360 --> 56:46.444
or with makeup?

56:53.284 --> 56:56.496
What on earth does he want me to bring?

57:00.542 --> 57:01.376
Right.

57:02.085 --> 57:05.296
He told me to throw the jacket away,
so he wouldn't ask me to bring it.

57:05.380 --> 57:06.756
It has to be the comic book.

57:07.674 --> 57:10.927
But my number would be easier to find
through kids from school.

57:12.512 --> 57:13.763
Is it the jacket?

57:18.476 --> 57:19.769
You're Lim Ju-kyung?

57:21.438 --> 57:22.897
How dare you deceive me?

57:26.443 --> 57:28.403
You're the acne girl from the comics shop?

57:30.905 --> 57:32.365
How dare you deceive me?

57:34.200 --> 57:35.493
You…

57:38.037 --> 57:38.955
You're…

57:45.795 --> 57:47.464
Why? Is there a problem?

57:49.048 --> 57:50.049
You're crazy.

57:54.596 --> 57:57.056
What do you want me to do?

58:13.323 --> 58:15.992
Hee-kyung!

58:17.243 --> 58:19.078
Where did she go?

58:22.373 --> 58:23.541
Hey, Lim Ju-young.

58:24.876 --> 58:27.504
What's up with your face? It's ridiculous.

58:27.587 --> 58:29.005
You're not busy, are you?

58:29.088 --> 58:31.090
- Please do me a favor.
- Favor?

58:31.174 --> 58:33.927
Just one favor
and I'll deliver you comics for life.

58:34.010 --> 58:35.762
No, I'll be your little sister.

58:35.845 --> 58:36.679
Please?

58:37.388 --> 58:39.724
Really? That's a tempting offer.

58:39.807 --> 58:41.559
Thanks, big brother.

58:41.643 --> 58:42.560
So can you please--

58:42.644 --> 58:45.563
Unfortunately, your big brother
already has plans.

58:45.647 --> 58:47.649
I'll do you a favor some other time.

58:47.732 --> 58:49.025
Big brother.

58:49.108 --> 58:51.361
Is it more important than me?

58:51.444 --> 58:52.737
Are you kidding? Obviously.

58:52.820 --> 58:55.365
Let go of me. Jeez.

58:55.448 --> 58:56.824
I don't need it.

58:57.575 --> 58:58.576
What do I do?

59:39.075 --> 59:40.076
I'm not late, am I?

59:40.159 --> 59:41.160
What's with the helmet?

59:42.203 --> 59:43.663
We all wear one when riding bicycles.

59:43.746 --> 59:45.331
If you fall, you could faceplant.

59:45.415 --> 59:47.000
It's as risky as a motorcycle.

59:47.875 --> 59:50.587
You said you're not feeling well.
Why did you ride a dangerous bicycle here?

59:52.964 --> 59:54.549
I'm not feeling well,

59:54.632 --> 59:57.176
so I took a bicycle
to make it quick and get some rest.

59:58.469 --> 59:59.887
Then hurry and give it to me.

01:00:00.930 --> 01:00:02.515
CURSED MASK

01:00:02.599 --> 01:00:03.516
Where is it?

01:00:04.517 --> 01:00:05.977
Where can it be?

01:00:06.060 --> 01:00:08.146
Is it that hard to find in there?

01:00:09.939 --> 01:00:11.482
CURSED MASK

01:00:11.566 --> 01:00:13.443
- The comic book.
- The comic book.

01:00:13.526 --> 01:00:14.944
Give it to me.

01:00:15.445 --> 01:00:17.363
Right, it was the comic book then.

01:00:18.781 --> 01:00:20.116
You know it's a steal, right?

01:00:20.199 --> 01:00:21.993
Keep that in mind, okay? I'm off.

01:00:22.076 --> 01:00:23.453
I ordered you something warm.

01:00:24.537 --> 01:00:25.538
Have it before you go.

01:00:25.622 --> 01:00:27.582
No, I'm all right. I don't need it.

01:00:27.665 --> 01:00:28.958
Then should I throw it away?

01:00:30.710 --> 01:00:32.337
I'm really okay.

01:00:32.420 --> 01:00:33.713
You really didn't have to.

01:00:33.796 --> 01:00:35.298
Are you going to keep that on?

01:00:37.216 --> 01:00:39.636
- I can use the straw.
- Why? It looks hot in there.

01:00:40.637 --> 01:00:42.180
It's cold sweat from getting better.

01:00:45.141 --> 01:00:46.142
Everyone's staring.

01:00:47.393 --> 01:00:48.728
Let them stare.

01:00:53.024 --> 01:00:54.192
You're being weird today.

01:00:58.321 --> 01:00:59.947
I'll take it off in the restroom.

01:01:23.805 --> 01:01:26.015
- Let's get out.
- Yes, let's go.

01:01:26.099 --> 01:01:27.183
I'm sorry.

01:01:31.396 --> 01:01:32.980
Why all this trouble?

01:01:34.732 --> 01:01:36.818
Isn't being ugly bad enough?

01:01:46.369 --> 01:01:47.745
Isn't he so good-looking?

01:01:48.538 --> 01:01:49.997
- Maybe he's a celebrity.
- Right?

01:02:00.049 --> 01:02:01.718
I washed my face since I was sweaty.

01:02:08.516 --> 01:02:10.059
So how did you get my number?

01:02:11.310 --> 01:02:12.311
Through Prince Comics.

01:02:15.565 --> 01:02:18.609
You must have really wanted that
to ask me to bring it at this hour.

01:02:19.527 --> 01:02:20.403
Yes.

01:02:22.238 --> 01:02:23.156
By the way,

01:02:23.948 --> 01:02:27.034
my secret you promised to keep…

01:02:27.118 --> 01:02:28.161
What about it?

01:02:28.828 --> 01:02:31.080
If I were to ask you what that was…

01:02:31.164 --> 01:02:32.290
that'd mean I'm crazy, right?

01:02:33.374 --> 01:02:34.417
Right.

01:02:38.755 --> 01:02:40.965
Let's take turns
asking each other questions.

01:02:43.801 --> 01:02:45.928
No, let's not.

01:03:21.589 --> 01:03:24.509
Thank goodness. He didn't figure it out.

01:03:31.557 --> 01:03:34.852
Anyway, I have to change my phone number.

01:03:36.229 --> 01:03:38.648
I can't fall asleep

01:03:39.565 --> 01:03:42.109
thinking about having
to avoid him tomorrow.

01:04:06.092 --> 01:04:07.218
Hey, Ju-kyung.

01:04:14.433 --> 01:04:17.436
Excuse me, your jacket.

01:04:25.194 --> 01:04:27.697
- Are you okay?
- I'm fine.

01:04:29.282 --> 01:04:30.491
What was that?

01:04:50.678 --> 01:04:51.554
Gosh!

01:04:52.221 --> 01:04:53.222
Su-ah, out!

01:04:56.559 --> 01:04:57.894
- Hey!
- What?

01:04:57.977 --> 01:05:00.563
- I got it.
- All right!

01:05:03.149 --> 01:05:04.734
- What was that?
- Jeez.

01:05:15.161 --> 01:05:16.037
Nice!

01:05:16.579 --> 01:05:18.998
Han Seo-jun, out!

01:05:19.665 --> 01:05:21.918
Han Seo-jun, out.

01:05:23.544 --> 01:05:24.462
So sneaky.

01:05:29.842 --> 01:05:30.676
Hey.

01:05:32.970 --> 01:05:34.013
Hey.

01:05:35.723 --> 01:05:36.599
Yes?

01:05:37.767 --> 01:05:39.101
You've seen me before, right?

01:05:40.519 --> 01:05:41.771
I'm not sure what you mean.

01:05:42.521 --> 01:05:44.774
You ran off with my helmet.

01:05:45.566 --> 01:05:46.609
Didn't you?

01:05:47.485 --> 01:05:48.819
Hey, look!

01:05:48.903 --> 01:05:51.280
I didn't fall for that last time either.

01:05:53.908 --> 01:05:55.952
- What was that?
- I'm sorry.

01:05:56.035 --> 01:05:57.870
It was the class president.

01:05:58.788 --> 01:06:00.289
Sorry. I'll bring it tomorrow.

01:06:10.091 --> 01:06:12.635
Goodness. Limju, are you okay?

01:06:12.718 --> 01:06:14.303
That jerk.

01:06:17.223 --> 01:06:18.557
He could have helped.

01:06:18.641 --> 01:06:19.475
That's it.

01:06:19.558 --> 01:06:21.769
Ignore me even if
I'm on the ground bleeding.

01:06:21.852 --> 01:06:24.438
- He's such a jerk.
- It's better than my secret getting out.

01:06:25.606 --> 01:06:27.316
Why is your boyfriend skipping lunch?

01:06:27.900 --> 01:06:30.319
He's doing homework,
so he's getting snacks instead.

01:06:30.403 --> 01:06:32.738
Really? Should we get him something then?

01:06:32.822 --> 01:06:34.865
I don't care if he starves or not.

01:06:34.949 --> 01:06:36.826
What is it? Did you two fight again?

01:06:36.909 --> 01:06:38.452
We didn't even have time for that.

01:06:39.036 --> 01:06:41.914
He's been ignoring my calls and texts
since yesterday evening.

01:06:41.998 --> 01:06:44.125
I don't think he knows
it's our 100th-day anniversary.

01:06:44.208 --> 01:06:45.876
I'm really annoyed.

01:06:46.502 --> 01:06:49.088
I'm sure he wouldn't
have forgotten about it.

01:06:49.171 --> 01:06:52.091
If he actually forgot, that's it.
I'm breaking up with him.

01:06:52.174 --> 01:06:54.635
He's the only guy I've dated for 100 days.

01:06:55.970 --> 01:06:57.054
It's their 100th day.

01:06:57.138 --> 01:06:59.098
- Is she on her way?
- What's he doing?

01:06:59.181 --> 01:07:01.142
100 DAYS OF TAE-HOON AND SU-AH
I LOVE YOU SU-AH

01:07:01.225 --> 01:07:02.893
- Thanks.
- Make sure it looks good.

01:07:02.977 --> 01:07:04.895
- All right.
- Hey, fix it here.

01:07:04.979 --> 01:07:08.357
Hey, why do I have to make
a flower path for your girlfriend

01:07:08.441 --> 01:07:09.734
when mine is full of poop?

01:07:09.817 --> 01:07:11.819
I get it. I'll set you up
with someone, okay?

01:07:11.902 --> 01:07:12.987
Set me up?

01:07:13.904 --> 01:07:15.448
I'll make this path beautiful.

01:07:15.531 --> 01:07:16.824
Hey, is Su-ah coming?

01:07:17.408 --> 01:07:18.576
Yes, she's coming.

01:07:18.659 --> 01:07:20.745
- Hey, get ready.
- Here she comes!

01:07:31.213 --> 01:07:33.382
SU-AH, IN MY EYES,
YOU'RE PRETTIER THAN BAE SUZY

01:07:33.466 --> 01:07:35.301
EVEN WHEN YOU GET OLD AND WIZENED

01:07:37.928 --> 01:07:39.680
I'LL STILL LOVE YOU

01:07:54.361 --> 01:07:58.157
I like you
I like everything about you

01:08:05.831 --> 01:08:07.333
My goodness.

01:08:10.753 --> 01:08:11.962
You're awesome!

01:08:13.380 --> 01:08:14.298
Su-ah,

01:08:15.508 --> 01:08:17.468
I'll end up in hell

01:08:17.551 --> 01:08:19.887
for stealing an angel called Su-ah
from the heavens.

01:08:19.970 --> 01:08:21.055
Flutter.

01:08:21.138 --> 01:08:22.723
Fluttering.

01:08:22.807 --> 01:08:25.559
And keeping you in my heart.

01:08:25.643 --> 01:08:27.895
I love you, my angel!

01:08:30.523 --> 01:08:31.857
Thank you!

01:08:33.943 --> 01:08:36.987
- Kiss!
- Kiss!

01:08:37.071 --> 01:08:42.618
- Kiss!
- Kiss!

01:08:42.701 --> 01:08:45.663
You guys are too much. Enough is enough!

01:08:56.632 --> 01:08:58.008
Goodness, Ju-kyung!

01:08:59.176 --> 01:09:00.219
- Oh no, Ju-kyung!
- Oh, no.

01:09:00.302 --> 01:09:01.804
Get her some paper towels.

01:09:01.887 --> 01:09:03.305
Why did you dodge?

01:09:03.389 --> 01:09:06.100
- Why did you throw the cake?
- You punk.

01:09:06.183 --> 01:09:07.393
You guys.

01:09:07.476 --> 01:09:08.811
Let's wipe some down first.

01:09:08.894 --> 01:09:11.230
Wet wipes won't do it.
She'll have to wash her face.

01:09:11.313 --> 01:09:13.524
If I wash my face, my true face will show.

01:09:13.607 --> 01:09:14.483
No.

01:09:14.567 --> 01:09:17.820
- Right. Let's wash your face with water.
- Let's go.

01:09:17.903 --> 01:09:19.029
Everyone, stop!

01:09:21.991 --> 01:09:25.077
Nobody touch me.

01:09:27.121 --> 01:09:28.372
Hey, Ju-kyung.

01:09:29.165 --> 01:09:31.083
- Hey.
- Ju-kyung!

01:09:32.418 --> 01:09:33.377
It's Han Seo-jun.

01:09:51.395 --> 01:09:53.189
Hey, hold on.

01:10:03.532 --> 01:10:05.910
Get out of my way!

01:10:11.957 --> 01:10:13.334
What the…

01:10:14.460 --> 01:10:16.086
What was that?

01:10:16.795 --> 01:10:19.632
- Lim Ju-kyung?
- Ju-kyung!

01:10:23.636 --> 01:10:24.803
Ju-kyung!

01:10:25.304 --> 01:10:27.890
Are you kidding me? Seriously?

01:10:27.973 --> 01:10:29.058
What the heck?

01:10:36.023 --> 01:10:37.483
You scared me.

01:10:39.652 --> 01:10:40.903
Goodness!

01:10:42.196 --> 01:10:44.698
- I'm sorry.
- Let's wipe your face.

01:10:44.782 --> 01:10:47.493
- Sorry.
- Ju-kyung, let's wipe your face.

01:10:51.372 --> 01:10:52.790
Ju-kyung, are you okay?

01:10:52.873 --> 01:10:54.291
She's upset because of you.

01:10:54.375 --> 01:10:55.626
Why did you throw it?

01:10:55.709 --> 01:10:57.169
- Apologize properly.
- Come on.

01:10:57.253 --> 01:10:58.504
- What's wrong with you?
- Jeez.

01:10:58.587 --> 01:11:00.047
- I'm sorry.
- Why did you do that?

01:11:00.130 --> 01:11:01.340
- Let's wipe it a bit.
- I'm sorry.

01:11:01.423 --> 01:11:03.300
- I'll wipe it for you.
- No, don't.

01:11:03.926 --> 01:11:05.844
- What's happening?
- Who is she?

01:11:05.928 --> 01:11:08.430
Isn't she the new girl? The famed goddess?

01:11:23.696 --> 01:11:24.530
Who…

01:11:26.865 --> 01:11:27.908
Who is that?

01:11:29.994 --> 01:11:33.289
Guys, it's me, Ju-kyung.

01:11:35.666 --> 01:11:36.792
What is she saying?

01:11:37.543 --> 01:11:40.587
- That's ridiculous.
- That's you, Ju-kyung?

01:11:40.671 --> 01:11:41.839
It was just all makeup?

01:11:41.922 --> 01:11:43.340
You're a con artist.

01:11:43.424 --> 01:11:45.050
You're so ugly.

01:11:45.718 --> 01:11:47.511
What was that about being a goddess?

01:11:47.594 --> 01:11:49.680
You look awful without makeup.

01:11:49.763 --> 01:11:52.224
What exactly happened to your face?

01:11:52.308 --> 01:11:53.559
I'm getting nauseous.

01:11:54.268 --> 01:11:56.020
This is huge news.

01:12:00.858 --> 01:12:03.736
Why are you acting this way?
We're friends.

01:12:03.819 --> 01:12:04.653
- Friends?
- Hey.

01:12:04.737 --> 01:12:07.489
We wouldn't have been friends
if I'd known you looked like this.

01:12:07.573 --> 01:12:08.615
She's ridiculous.

01:12:08.699 --> 01:12:10.492
- What friends?
- You're so ridiculous!

01:13:10.386 --> 01:13:12.221
- What was that?
- What's happening?

01:14:06.358 --> 01:14:07.693
Does he really know?

01:14:07.776 --> 01:14:10.404
At my school,
there's someone who reminds me of you.

01:14:13.115 --> 01:14:14.533
Why do you keep running away from me?

01:14:14.616 --> 01:14:16.034
These are for me?

01:14:16.118 --> 01:14:19.163
"You can postpone studying
but never falling in love."

01:14:19.246 --> 01:14:21.123
Hey, Ju-kyung. Are you seeing Soo-ho?

01:14:21.206 --> 01:14:22.624
What's he doing here?

01:14:24.376 --> 01:14:25.335
Don't get off track.

01:14:25.919 --> 01:14:27.171
Yet you seem to be doing well.

01:14:27.754 --> 01:14:30.799
All this trouble
because you're too pretty.

01:14:31.675 --> 01:14:32.843
I love you.

01:14:33.635 --> 01:14:38.640
Subtitle translation by: Sun-young Ahn
